From f22251af87650363198d78f1fbe50dcb23f94913 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Schumacher <schumacher@b1-systems.de>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:16:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add space-report extension

Admin status report of personal/project/vault spaces, storage usage,
quota alerts and orphaned spaces, with PDF/Markdown/CSV export and
saving the report to the personal space.

Signed-off-by: Samuel Schumacher <schumacher@b1-systems.de>
